Viktor 11.10.2026, with his picture: «В хедере стиля иконки муж. жен. смещены в своей клетке вправо». Measured on the live page (claude-voicetog-probe.mjs): their padding was 10 px a side, .btn.small's (two classes) over .voice-tog's own 0 (one class), so in a button of 24 px the drawing of 16 px had 2 px and ran out on the right; .voice-togs .voice-tog { padding: 0 }.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 74dcc1f..fa72f16 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4078,6 +4078,7 @@ html.i18n-wait .boot-veil > * { visibility: hidden; }
 /* HERESY 1281: ♂ and ♀ in the Style's head, lit by what the Style says */
 .voice-togs { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; }
 .voice-tog { width: 24px; height: 24px; min-width: 0; padding: 0; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; color: var(--dim); }
+.voice-togs .voice-tog { padding: 0; }             /* HERESY 1373: .btn.small's padding (two classes) beat the one above: the sign ran out on the right */
 .voice-tog .ui-ico { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
 .voice-tog.is-on { color: var(--amber); border-color: var(--amber); }
 .style-warn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 2px 9px 2px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--amber); border-radius: 999px;
-- 
